{
  "name": "Schedule interviews from Greenhouse stage changes with Google Calendar, Claude and Twilio",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Webhook: Read the stage"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "util:SetVariables",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": null,
      "mapper": {
        "scope": "roundtrip",
        "variables": [
          {
            "name": "config_your_name",
            "value": "Your name — signs every outgoing message"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_your_email",
            "value": "you@example.com"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_your_company",
            "value": "Your company or brokerage"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_timezone",
            "value": "Europe/London"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_quiet_hours_start",
            "value": "21"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_quiet_hours_end",
            "value": "8"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_approval_mode",
            "value": "true"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_approver",
            "value": "#approvals — a Slack channel, or an email address"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_test_mode",
            "value": "true"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_schedule",
            "value": "instant (webhook)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Config (edit me)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "google-calendar:createAnEvent",
      "version": 5,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "calendar": "{{2.config_your_email}}",
        "summary": "{{1.subject}}",
        "start": "{{1.start}}",
        "end": "{{1.end}}",
        "allDay": false,
        "visibility": "default",
        "sendUpdates": "none"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Google Calendar: Find common slots"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "to": [
          "{{3.email}}"
        ],
        "subject": "{{3.subject}}",
        "html": "{{3.draft}}",
        "attachments": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 900,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Gmail: Offer the slots"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "module": "google-calendar:createAnEvent",
      "version": 5,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "calendar": "{{2.config_your_email}}",
        "summary": "{{4.subject}}",
        "start": "{{4.start}}",
        "end": "{{4.end}}",
        "allDay": false,
        "visibility": "default",
        "sendUpdates": "none"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1200,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Google Calendar: Book"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "module": "twilio:SendSMS",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "to": "{{5.phone}}",
        "body": "{{5.draft}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1500,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Twilio: Remind"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "module": "anthropic-claude:createAMessage",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-5",
        "system": "You are the \"Handle changes\" step of the Interview Scheduling Automation workflow run by Agentmelt.\nTask: A reply asking to move, cancel or ask a question is understood and acted on in the same thread; new slots are offered without the recruiter.\n\nRules:\n- Panel working hours and blocked times are respected; the workflow never books over a 'focus' block or outside hours.\n- Candidates are never offered a slot less than 24 hours away unless the recruiter allows it for the stage.\n- Every change is written to the same email thread, so the candidate has one conversation, not five.\n- SMS only with a number the candidate gave; opt-out honoured.\n- The recruiter is copied on every candidate-facing message and can take over any thread by replying.\n- Answer only from the data provided in the input. If something is missing, say so in the output instead of guessing.\n- If this step produces a message or a document, put the full text in `draft` (and a `subject` if it is an email); put a one-line summary in `summary`.\n- Set `needs_human` true whenever you are unsure, the input is unusual, or a rule above applies; a person will look at it.\n- Return valid JSON matching the output schema; no prose outside the JSON.\n\nReply with a single JSON object and nothing else: the fields the task needs, plus \"needs_human\" (true when unsure), \"confidence\" (0–1) and \"summary\" (one line).",
        "messages": [
          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Handle changes.\n\nItem (map the fields your source provides here):\n{{6.text}}{{6.body}}{{6.message}}{{6.subject}}{{6.email}}{{6.name}}{{6.data}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "max_tokens": "2000",
        "temperature": "0.2",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1800,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Claude: Handle changes"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "module": "json:ParseJSON",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "json": "{{7.textResponse}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Parse Claude's JSON: Handle changes"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": null,
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 2400,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Gate: Handle changes"
        }
      },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 11,
              "module": "builtin:ThrowWarning",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "message": "Parked for a person — Handle changes: {{8.summary}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2700,
                  "y": 0,
                  "name": "Needs a person: Handle changes"
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Needs a person?",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{8.needs_human}}",
                      "b": "true",
                      "o": "boolean:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 9,
              "module": "http:MakeRequest",
              "version": 4,
              "parameters": {
                "authenticationType": "basicAuth"
              },
              "mapper": {
                "url": "https://harvest.greenhouse.io/v1/applications/{{ $json.application_id }}/move",
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [],
                "queryParameters": [],
                "parseResponse": true,
                "stopOnHttpError": true,
                "timeout": "",
                "allowRedirects": true,
                "shareCookies": false,
                "requestCompressedContent": true,
                "contentType": "json",
                "inputMethod": "jsonString",
                "jsonStringBodyContent": "{\n  \"from_stage_id\": \"{{ $json.from_stage_id }}\",\n  \"to_stage_id\": \"{{ $json.to_stage_id }}\"\n}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2700,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Greenhouse Harvest API: Sync the ATS"
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Continue",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{8.needs_human}}",
                      "b": "true",
                      "o": "boolean:notequal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 10,
              "module": "google-sheets:addRow",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "from": "drive",
                "mode": "select",
                "values": {
                  "0": "{{8.summary}}"
                },
                "sheetId": "Sheet1",
                "spreadsheetId": "",
                "includesHeaders": true,
                "insertDataOption": "INSERT_ROWS",
                "valueInputOption": "USER_ENTERED",
                "insertUnformatted": false
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 3000,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Google Sheets: Report"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "slots": null,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "moduleIds": [
          2
        ],
        "content": "## Schedule interviews from Greenhouse stage changes with Google Calendar, Claude and Twilio\n\nRecruiters and coordinators who spend their week on calendar tennis.\n\n### How it works\nTrigger: Moving a candidate to an interview stage in Greenhouse, Lever or Ashby — or a row change in the tracking sheet — starts scheduling for that stage's panel.\n1. Read the stage\n2. Find common slots\n3. Offer the slots\n4. Book\n5. Remind\n6. Handle changes\n7. Sync the ATS\n8. Report\nEvery AI step is followed by a \"Needs a person?\" gate that parks low-confidence items.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open \"Config (edit me)\" and fill in the fields (names, approver, quiet hours, thresholds).\n2. Add credentials: Anthropic, plus Greenhouse / Lever / Ashby, Google Calendar / Outlook, Twilio.\n3. Run once with test_mode on, read the output, then switch the trigger on.\n\n### Customization tips\nSet the interviewer pools and the working hours in the Config node; swap Google Calendar for Outlook.\nGuardrail to keep: Panel working hours and blocked times are respected; the workflow never books over a 'focus' block or outside hours.\n\nFull blueprint: https://agentmelt.com/workflows/interview-scheduling-automation/",
        "isFilterNote": false,
        "metadata": {
          "color": "#F5D451"
        }
      }
    ],
    "zone": "eu1.make.com"
  }
}